	(text "U1 LM4040-5.0 shunt reference, biased by R1 (10k) from -12V,\ndecoupled by C9 (100nF). Sets the +2.5V CV mid-rail offset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 59.224 168.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8a8568c3-e97a-4229-af98-d16c51171421")
	)
	(text "EURORACK POWER SUPPLY\n+12V -> D8 (SS14) -> VIN_SEED -> Daisy Seed VIN (onboard TPS6217 buck, 5-17V in)\n+12V -> U2 (L7805, D2PAK) -> +5V  for TM1637 display, U5, U6, D6 clamp\n+/-12V reverse-protected (D1/D2, SS14) + ferrite-filtered (FB1/FB2)\n-5V shunt reference (U1) -> CV summing offset (see cv_io)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.306 46.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b1000000-0001-0000-0000-000000000000")
	)
	(text "D8 (SS14): series Schottky, +12V -> VIN_SEED.\nIsolates Seed VIN from the +5V rail (fixes USB+Eurorack contention)\nand blocks backfeed to the +12V bus. VIN ~11.6V.\nSeed generates its own +3V3 internally."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.55 114.808 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b1000000-00c0-0000-0000-000000000000")
	)
	(text "C5: 10uF 16V tantalum, THT, HAND-SOLDERED (not in the JLC SMT run).\nTantalum chosen deliberately - controlled ESR keeps U2 stable."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 59.224 161.832 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b942e747-4312-4993-ab8c-10d291ebbac5")
	)
	(text "U2 load = TM1637 display + U5 + U6 only (~0.2W).\nTab = GND, solid zone connect + 16 thermal vias."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 59.436 143.764 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ba5972bb-ea64-4fdf-917a-e35df152d21f")
	)
	(text "C2/C4 bulk + bypass on +12V; C1/C3 on -12V; C6 on +5V.\nC1/C2 = 10uF 50V X7R ceramic, non-polar\n(tantalum was over-derated on a 12V rail)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 59.436 153.764 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e6169c27-2fdb-43b1-a18b-7858a0c0d102")
	)
